! Through-focus range (CODE V FFO / IFO / NFO): system data that is set,
! queried, saved with the lens, exported to CODE V and reset by a new lens.
! (first: CODE V export/import of the startup lens, whose bare WL line hung
! the importer)
ZOA2CV blank.seq
CV2PRG blank.seq
RES osdtriplet
NFO
FFO -0.1
IFO 0.05
NFO 5
! bad input
NFO 19
NFO 2.5
FFO
FFO A
FFO
IFO
NFO
SAV focustest
LEN NEW
FFO
IFO
NFO
RES focustest
FFO
IFO
NFO
ZOA2CV focustrip.seq
LEN NEW
CV2PRG focustrip.seq
FFO
IFO
NFO
